# Add Lint Rule

## Overview

Use the **`add-lint-rule` skill** when adding a lint or static-analysis check.
Implement in **ast-grep** if possible, existing static analysis tools otherwise,
and hand-rolled scripts only as a last resort. A check is incomplete until it
runs in a blocking CI job.

## Usage

Use the Skill tool with command "add-lint-rule"

